OL,3,AEx-Brookside star who fled after fraud
OL,4,Atrial arrested in Spain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Crime Agency (NCA) said
OL,7,Fthat after jumping bail, Foster was
OL,8,Fconvicted and sentenced in his absence
OL,9,Fat Sheffield Crown Court in February
OL,10,F2025. He was arrested by officers on
OL,11,FThursday in Alicante.
